qs.append({"q":"At the Karachi session, the Congress adopted two significant resolutions — on Fundamental Rights and on the National Economic Programme. Which of the following was part of the Fundamental Rights resolution?","o":["Universal adult franchise and neutrality of the state in religious matters","State ownership of key industries","Reduction in land revenue for peasants","Right to workers and peasants to form unions"],"a":0,"e":"The Fundamental Rights resolution included universal adult franchise, free speech, state neutrality in religion, and equal legal rights, among other civil liberties; the economic provisions belonged to the separate National Economic Programme resolution."})

qs.append({"q":"The Karachi Resolution's National Economic Programme included proposals such as:","o":["State ownership and control of key industries, mines and means of transport, along with a living wage and limited working hours","Complete privatisation of all industries","Abolition of trade unions","Elimination of land revenue reduction demands"],"a":0,"e":"The National Economic Programme envisioned state control of key industries and infrastructure, alongside labour protections like living wages and limited hours — marking the Congress's first detailed articulation of economic goals for the masses."})

