qs.append({"q":"In the first four months of the resumed Civil Disobedience Movement (from January 1932), approximately how many satyagrahis, mostly urban and rural poor, were jailed?","o":["About 80,000","About 8,000","About 5,00,000","About 15,000"],"a":0,"e":"Approximately 80,000 satyagrahis were jailed in just the first four months of the resumed movement, reflecting the scale of repression as well as continued popular participation."})

